  "prefLabel": "Env-Hw 808.04 Storage Facility Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Hw 808.04 Storage Facility Requirements. Any person who stores recyclable materials used for precious metal recovery shall:\n\n(a) Comply with:\n\n(1) The notification requirements of Env-Hw 702;\n\n(2) The manifest requirements of Env-Hw 703; and\n\n(3) For precious metals exported to or imported from other countries for recovery, 40 CFR 262 Subpart H and 40 CFR 265.12; and\n\n(b) To document that the materials are not being accumulated speculatively, as determined under Env-Hw 807, maintain records of:\n\n(1) The amount of materials stored at the beginning of the calendar year;\n\n(2) The amount of materials generated or received during the calendar year; and\n\n(3) The amount of materials remaining at the end of the calendar year.\n\nSource. #5053, eff 1-24-91; ss by #5886, eff 8-26-94; ss by #7333, eff 8-1-00; ss by #9215, INTERIM, eff 8-1-08; ss by #9367, eff 1-28-09; ss by #12350, eff 8-14-17 (formerly Env-Hw 808.03); ss by #12922, eff 11-23-19; ss by #14526, eff 2-28-26, EXPIRES: 2-28-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-hw800.html"
